ncy and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qNzQJ7CRQjwQ7kNvwGr45JA&_nc_oc=AdqxD21Z7bJeW8e7lWbObOwhLgxy41kcgrlZSzl_DU9W3nJa2jNwzlUiV1B5JXKVTcc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF76smNZvbCEsY5Phkn7QfpdMrc-HCH1_kF1Hent2iIWA&oe=6A806A39"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VcRN47lXuz4Q7kNvwEAkUsi&_nc_oc=Adp4xME-ydbYoEO9iwXv0u6tP8vqS0K5-W-I7dLBYKb3m8hl4vAPptWRujCBYyO7vIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGboP9sTKJxvAwYu4RPtCZ-5_kQDnuFxglnyLvlIwBQJg&oe=6A80588F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ge5isaunREgQ7kNvwFAlkVI&_nc_oc=AdpDxu5KsI9JG4Xls8Jr4tUsWddf2qMUXqtqHlJiCdw8Lg7tatuA7NZwss8CSRw1zZ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHMGKKu6ao_AZ4HgoNOGQAV_9-7nuCzdC5hZ10zkEwAMg&oe=6A80666E"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squar